        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>Silver</thingDef>
          <count>150</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>ComponentIndustrial</thingDef>
          <count>10</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>Steel</thingDef>
          <count>200</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>WoodLog</thingDef>
          <count>250</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
          <def>GameStartDialog</def>
          <text>Three weeks of walking, and the guns behind you have finally gone quiet. This valley is as far from the front as your boots could carry you.\n\nNobody here knows your names. Your old unit still has them written down.</text>
          <closeSound>GameStartSting</closeSound>
        </li>
      </parts>
    </scenario>
  </ScenarioDef>

  <!-- ===================== Bad Blood ===================== -->

  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>Council_Scenario_BadBlood</defName>
    <label>Bad Blood</label>
    <description>Two families, one valley, and three generations of bad blood. When the colony ship broke apart, the only pods that launched carried the last of two clans who haven't shared a meal in living memory. Now they'll have to share everything.\n\nEach family keeps its own name and sticks by its own. Expect cold shoulders, harsh words, rivalries, and a council where every vote is a family vote.\n\nNo one is coming to attack you; the trouble is all at home. The grudge fades over a month or two, faster if the families find reasons to work together.</description>
    <scenario>
      <summary>Six survivors from two feuding families, forced to build one colony together. No extra fights, just drama. (Rimfolk · gentle)</summary>
      <playerFaction>
        <def>PlayerFaction</def>
        <factionDef>PlayerColony</factionDef>
      </playerFaction>
      <parts>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns">
